<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Inspec raised at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inspec raised at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Speciality chemicals group Inspec Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at BZW after Tuesday's better-than-expected results, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Inspec reported a 57 percent rise in pre-tax profit to 24.7 million stg for the first half ended June 30.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2-1/2p at 188-1/2 by 1100 GMT in moderate volume of 648,933 shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
